t=1691674960\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567100/extras/2f868d2d07821f5ec7dc39faeab9889a.webm?t=1691674960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1567100/extras/2f868d2d07821f5ec7dc39faeab9889a.mp4?t=1691674960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>What else?</strong><br>Download the demo &gt; Play &gt; Explore and Repeat &gt; Wishlist and Follow",
    "short_description": "Repeat is a sci-fi first-person platformer with parkour and puzzle elements. The mysterious head in your hands belongs to an unknown Dullahan and she has the ability to repeat space infinitely. Face to face you try to find a way out of the world around you. How? And when?",
